 ## Smoke Test Verification
-Describe how to run smoke tests.
+After deploying to staging, verify the endpoints by running the smoke script:
+
+```bash
+export OCR_URL=<OCR endpoint>
+export SLACK_URL=<Slack actions endpoint>
+export INVOICE_POST_URL=<Invoice post endpoint>
+export SLACK_SECRET=<Slack signing secret>
+bash scripts/smoke.sh
+```
+
+The script will call each endpoint and check for expected keys.
+
+## Rollback
+
+To roll back the staging environment:
+
+```bash
+serverless remove --stage staging
+```
+
+This will delete the deployed resources. Note that the archive S3 bucket and its contents will be removed.
+
+## Log Inspection
+
+For troubleshooting, view CloudWatch logs for functions prefixed with ``invoice-hawk-staging``. Look for info and error logs to ensure correct behaviour.

